SYNOPSIS:
        string read_file(string file, int start, int number)

DESCRIPTION:
        Reads lines from file. If the optional start or number are not
        given, the whole file is read, otherwise <number> lines from
        start are read. read_file may only be applied to files with
	size less then 50000 bytes (currently)

SEE ALSO:
        read_bytes(E), write_file(E)
